    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Continue in the World of the DNA Universe...</strong></h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2801790/extras/0d3de820b1dd38b98520dcce0c33ac5a.poster.avif?t=1748549571\" width=600 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2801790/extras/0d3de820b1dd38b98520dcce0c33ac5a.webm?t=1748549571\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2801790/extras/0d3de820b1dd38b98520dcce0c33ac5a.mp4?t=1748549571\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>DNA Episode 2 is a continuation of DNA Episode 1 in the form of a 2D Story-driven Anime, Hack &amp; Slash Beat'em-up where you play as the main character Leo, as he has been summoned by Chairman Sujo entering the region of Kesho City. All in the effort to recover the alien specimen that Kesho has been using its technology to advance its city.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2801790/extras/3375d585dea4d33f49b5c21447004454.avif?t=1748549571\" width=616 height=308 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Continue your Journey to find The Purpose of One's DNA...</strong></h2><br><i><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Progress through Kesho City as you unlock unique new abilities in your skill tree.<br><br></li><li>Follow up with Leo's story in a new action-packed, hand-drawn world with gripping 2D hack &amp; slash gameplay.<br><br></li><li> Uncover Leo's mission to retrieve the alien specimen in Kesho City as you progress through each scenario. </li></ul></i><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2801790/extras/8140bd191abb2e7fe131823599455044.avif?t=1748549571\" width=616 height=308 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Pick up on Familiar Gameplay...</strong></h2><br><i><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Experience welcoming 2D Beat'em up gameplay with new abilities to acquire!<br><br></li><li>Continue playing a challenging gameplay formula building upon DNA Episode 1's rewarding difficulties.<br><br></li><li> Uncover many new foes and ways to defeat them in the treacherous scenarios of Kesho City! </li></ul></i><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2801790/extras/ae645e4c8a13c44f05f0bf57bff1405f.avif?t=1748549571\" width=616 height=308 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>See more of DNA through Leo's Eyes...</strong></h2><br><i><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Watch as the story develops further into intriguing events in Episode 2 of DNA.<br><br></li><li>Move through the city as the Kesho military sends reinforcements to protect Kesho City from Leo and Novacorp.<br><br></li><li> Fight your way through Kesho City as the Kesho military sends Kesho Wartanks, Mechas, and Cyborgs to defend the City at all costs. </li></ul></i>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Continue in the World of the DNA Universe...</strong></h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2801790/extras/0d3de820b1dd38b98520dcce0c33ac5a.poster.avif?t=1748549571\" width=600 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2801790/extras/0d3de820b1dd38b98520dcce0c33ac5a.webm?t=1748549571\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2801790/extras/0d3de820b1dd38b98520dcce0c33ac5a.mp4?t=1748549571\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>DNA Episode 2 is a continuation of DNA Episode 1 in the form of a 2D Story-driven Anime, Hack &amp; Slash Beat'em-up where you play as the main character Leo, as he has been summoned by Chairman Sujo entering the region of Kesho City. All in the effort to recover the alien specimen that Kesho has been using its technology to advance its city.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2801790/extras/3375d585dea4d33f49b5c21447004454.avif?t=1748549571\" width=616 height=308 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Continue your Journey to find The Purpose of One's DNA...</strong></h2><br><i><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Progress through Kesho City as you unlock unique new abilities in your skill tree.<br><br></li><li>Follow up with Leo's story in a new action-packed, hand-drawn world with gripping 2D hack &amp; slash gameplay.<br><br></li><li> Uncover Leo's mission to retrieve the alien specimen in Kesho City as you progress through each scenario. </li></ul></i><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2801790/extras/8140bd191abb2e7fe131823599455044.avif?t=1748549571\" width=616 height=308 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Pick up on Familiar Gameplay...</strong></h2><br><i><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Experience welcoming 2D Beat'em up gameplay with new abilities to acquire!<br><br></li><li>Continue playing a challenging gameplay formula building upon DNA Episode 1's rewarding difficulties.<br><br></li><li> Uncover many new foes and ways to defeat them in the treacherous scenarios of Kesho City! </li></ul></i><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2801790/extras/ae645e4c8a13c44f05f0bf57bff1405f.avif?t=1748549571\" width=616 height=308 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>See more of DNA through Leo's Eyes...</strong></h2><br><i><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Watch as the story develops further into intriguing events in Episode 2 of DNA.<br><br></li><li>Move through the city as the Kesho military sends reinforcements to protect Kesho City from Leo and Novacorp.<br><br></li><li> Fight your way through Kesho City as the Kesho military sends Kesho Wartanks, Mechas, and Cyborgs to defend the City at all costs. </li></ul></i>",
    "short_description": "DNA 1 is a hand drawn episodic beat up up anime game created by a Solo Developer. Play as the protagonist Leo, a genetically modified with Extraterrestrial life Elite Nova Corp Troop, as he faces challenges on what path he must take to change his life. Thus begins the epic story of DNA!",
